Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:34.10,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now we're rowing our way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:34.48,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(350,462)}Timing\N{\fs40}Galaxy 9000\N\N{\fs}Time-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:40.60,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,to a hidden adventure at the dark bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.56,0:00:40.69,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294,442)}Quality-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil\NGalaxy 9000\NFeeso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.69,0:00:47.44,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it sound fun just thinking about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.90,0:00:44.07,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(766,480)}Video editing\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:47.44,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(765,540)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:51.85,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's travel all through the worldwide seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:54.18,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,raising our battle cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:00:56.82,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,498)}Raw provider\N{\fs40}SOFCJ-Raws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:58.52,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you've made up your mind, let the signal for departure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.69,0:01:00.96,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.33,0:01:11.53,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,That feeling we had when we set sail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:15.04,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,is something I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.19,0:01:16.81,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Because of that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:20.48,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,nothing will be able to scare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:26.75,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now, as the trip approaches, our racing heartbeats
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.93,0:01:33.69,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,engrave a rhythm of adventure in our shy hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:38.06,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:40.36,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:44.77,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.87,0:01:47.40,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.53,0:02:04.62,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fill your empty heart with dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.75,0:02:06.96,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:11.29,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you color your heart with the blowing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.39,0:02:13.63,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,you will move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:17.80,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.97,0:02:20.13,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.27,0:02:24.49,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.67,0:02:27.28,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:38.52,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(2000,2000)}船員全滅！\N奧茲 VS 噩夢魯夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:42.21,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}定住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:45.58,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我撐不{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.99,0:02:48.55,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,幹得好，羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.41,0:02:56.10,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你打算就這樣阻止我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:02:59.72,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,真是無意義的舉動。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:04.74,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}磚塊蝙蝠！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:10.99,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,羅賓小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.13,0:03:13.69,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}二十輪花！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.13,0:03:13.69,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}二十朵花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:15.66,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}金盞花！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:15.66,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}金盞花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:21.45,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:30.59,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你竟敢傷害羅賓小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.94,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,莫利亞的影子？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.09,0:03:53.41,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,那麼，來決定哪個能力比較強吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:56.48,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你這個固定術還真有效！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.45,0:03:59.77,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,我不應該在意他的影子。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.77,0:04:03.40,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,如果擊倒本體，影子應該也會一起消滅。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:07.96,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}四手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:07.96,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}四隻手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.33,0:04:13.44,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,喂⋯喂，你！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:14.61,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你在做什{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:15.98,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:16.99,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鎖技！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:25.50,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,她做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.76,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你太厲害了，羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:31.48,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂，羅賓！小心你背後的影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:44.76,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,莫利亞怎麼在這裡？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.76,0:04:46.48,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,好險。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.48,0:04:47.85,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,可惜了，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.85,0:04:52.04,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我隨時都可以跟影法師交換位置。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:54.24,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,交換位置？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:56.78,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那，那邊的那個是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:02.75,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你的柔道關節技對我的影子沒用。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:06.53,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,沒錯，就是剛才在那裡的那個影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.03,0:05:16.43,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,羅賓小{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:31.46,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,現在倒下三個了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.22,0:05:35.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,羅賓的影子也被奪走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:40.02,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我現在沒有適合你的魁儡，所以就先把你留在身邊吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:47.71,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}惡魔風腳...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:47.71,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}惡魔之腳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:51.11,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你這卑鄙的混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:56.22,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,把羅賓小姐的影子還回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.82,0:05:58.32,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}特等肉末！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.82,0:05:58.32,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}最高級絞碎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:05:59.71,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}磚塊蝙蝠！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:06.61,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他又跟影子交換位置了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:13.29,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那就是說...！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:17.52,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,莫利亞又回到奧茲的肚子裡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:22.30,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你又回到原點了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:25.40,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,可惡，主人！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:28.30,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,別妨礙我的戰鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:30.02,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,抱歉了，奧茲。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:32.24,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我好像有點得意忘形了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:36.34,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我最好把那個女人解決掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:40.46,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:43.97,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他又能伸長了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:45.13,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不會吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:46.75,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,羅賓已經失去意識了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:52.96,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,香吉士！羅賓！快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.15,0:06:55.28,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火箭炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:57.13,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}惡魔風腳...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:06:59.92,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}油炸什錦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:06:59.92,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}油炸什錦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:10.24,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,被彈飛了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:17.70,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,現在是我們的機會！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:19.52,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,帶羅賓小姐離開！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:20.65,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,交給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:23.47,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:24.71,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:25.66,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:31.56,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,喬巴，你在那邊做什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:35.40,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我在調查五百年前奧茲的死因。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.82,0:07:37.87,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,死因？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:39.65,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,瞄準他的右臂！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.65,0:07:42.24,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,這不是奧茲原來的手臂！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:45.02,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,雖然被霍古巴克高超的技術修復了，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.02,0:07:48.01,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,但關節處殘留著嚴重凍傷的痕跡。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.06,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我不能完全確定，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:53.72,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,五百年前他的死因很可能是凍死。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:58.05,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,即使是這樣的怪物，也敵不過大自然的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:08:01.03,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他在冰之國遊蕩時凍死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.03,0:08:05.06,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,原因是，即使是五百年前，奧茲依然是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:07.22,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,光著身子的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:10.27,Main,Both,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我們居然輸給這種笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:14.85,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,殭屍或許感覺不到疼痛，但受到的傷害會累積。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.85,0:08:17.84,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他之前受到的所有攻擊一直在累積！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:22.81,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,如果解決掉這條手臂，他的戰鬥力就會減半！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.81,0:08:24.62,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,總之，瞄準這個位{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:30.15,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,閉嘴吧，站在我肩上的小矮人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.81,0:08:33.99,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:45.54,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,像你這樣的殭屍根本察覺不到剛才那一拳對你身體的傷害！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:49.41,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,他在我手裡了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.41,0:08:54.67,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,以我現在的大小，你拳頭的縫隙就像巨大的洞穴一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.67,0:08:55.53,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}藍波球...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.15,0:08:57.17,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}跳躍強化！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.77,0:08:59.47,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}臂力強化！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:01.40,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.03,0:09:03.02,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,幹得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:04.42,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,讓我來幫你一把！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:06.21,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,香吉士，拜託你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:11.60,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}空軍...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:11.60,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}空軍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.98,0:09:14.52,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}刻蹄！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:16.87,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}櫻花射擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:16.87,Note,,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}櫻花射擊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.86,0:09:26.41,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.86,0:09:31.32,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,你們為什麼一直攻擊同一個地方？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:34.39,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,之前沒有用，現在也不會有用！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.39,0:09:35.77,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,會有用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.77,0:09:38.54,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,疼痛是保護身體的信號。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:41.59,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,感覺不到疼痛...並不會讓你變得更強！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.59,0:09:44.83,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,那你隨便說吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:46.57,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂，太危險了，你們兩個！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:47.47,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,快點離開！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:51.04,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:53.24,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,可惡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:54.89,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,糟了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:58.42,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}機關槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:02.57,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:03.98,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.15,0:10:21.60,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,又倒下兩個...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:25.80,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,大家...都被打倒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:27.36,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:32.81,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,四個！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.81,0:10:34.45,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,五個！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:38.12,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,只剩下三個了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.02,0:10:45.02,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,只...剩下三個了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.83,0:10:54.20,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,快點把他們碾碎吧，奧茲！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.41,0:10:57.27,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.69,0:11:02.78,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,沒有用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:05.38,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我們不可能打贏這種怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:07.58,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,已經沒有辦法了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:08.65,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,怎麼辦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:10.58,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.37,0:11:13.12,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我來製造空隙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.21,0:11:15.07,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我懂了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:16.79,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.79,0:11:18.40,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那就這樣吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:20.66,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你什麼意思，騙人布？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:23.66,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:26.82,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}手槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:31.14,Main,Oars,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.66,0:11:31.87,Secondary,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三刀流...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.21,0:11:35.33,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鴉魔斬！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.88,0:11:45.62,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,成功了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:46.68,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,有效嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.68,0:11:47.82,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,騙人布，現在{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.82,0:11:49.58,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,又攻擊我的右臂？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:53.36,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,跟你說過無數次了，沒有用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:59.25,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我要把你解決掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:00.80,Thoughts,Zoro,0,0,0,,他消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:06.72,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:11.38,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，奧茲！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:14.25,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,看這邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.22,0:12:21.06,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.06,0:12:24.09,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,有什麼東西...進了我的嘴裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.57,0:12:27.14,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,騙人布，那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.85,0:12:29.63,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我做到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:31.53,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,終於做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.53,0:12:35.46,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我終於讓奧茲吞下鹽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:36.66,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,鹽？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.66,0:12:38.29,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那又怎樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.29,0:12:40.85,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,原來你不知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.85,0:12:43.34,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,鹽是殭屍的弱點！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.34,0:12:46.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,看吧！奧茲到此為止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:53.42,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,魯夫的影子出來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:56.25,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,被淨化吧，巨大殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:59.11,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,勝利是我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.11,0:13:02.09,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,出來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:21.86,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,為什麼...是莫利亞的影子...？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:25.15,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我在裡面保護著他！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:28.80,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,真是個蠢蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:30.71,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,太早慶祝勝利了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:36.00,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你真以為我不會對這種弱點做好對策嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.56,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,白痴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:44.34,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.34,0:13:47.57,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我想這是你的吧，長鼻子！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.57,0:13:48.39,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:13:57.98,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不好了，鹽！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.98,0:13:59.62,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,布魯克費盡辛苦收集的鹽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:01.94,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,可惡！可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:04.22,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,在耍弄我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:08.23,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:10.90,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}印章！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:19.07,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:21.97,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:24.81,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.81,0:14:25.73,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,住手啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.73,0:14:26.72,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.72,0:14:28.37,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.10,0:14:30.60,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.23,0:14:34.47,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,還沒完！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:36.05,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,把他碾碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.05,0:14:38.07,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,那個女人也一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.51,0:14:48.63,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,碾碎他們！碾碎他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.13,0:14:52.17,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,把每一個都碾碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:55.87,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,連已經失去意識的也碾碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:59.13,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,他們還有一口氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:03.68,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,碾碎他們直到認不出是人類為止！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.46,0:15:14.06,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，大笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.49,0:15:20.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你以為你在踩什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.74,0:15:29.50,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你腳下沒有人。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:31.81,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,你是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.21,0:15:35.73,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我...我是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.91,0:15:39.02,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我得救了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:43.07,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不知道發生了什麼，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.07,0:15:44.57,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,謝謝你幫我們{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:46.09,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不會吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.43,0:15:51.23,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,蒙其·D·魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.63,0:15:55.48,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,魯⋯魯{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:56.58,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,魯{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:15:59.50,Main,Both,0,0,0,,魯夫？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:02.28,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,哪裡像？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.87,0:16:03.85,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你多少...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.85,0:16:05.58,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你多少有點像他，但是...！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:07.01,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,真的是你嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.01,0:16:08.58,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你是認真的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:11.28,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,真的是...我啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:13.32,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,嗯，你的說話方式倒是一樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:15.79,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你到底怎麼了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.79,0:16:21.37,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,他也有變身能力嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:22.79,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,還是...？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:28.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,大家都被打敗了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:29.47,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是⋯是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.15,0:16:34.18,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,除了我們之外，其他人都被那怪物打倒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:35.25,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:37.17,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,讓開。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.17,0:16:38.84,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,讓開？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.84,0:16:40.62,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你不明白嗎，魯夫？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.62,0:16:43.50,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那個殭屍擁有你的影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.50,0:16:47.50,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,而且他的身體還能伸長，使用你的招式！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:49.46,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,無所謂。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:51.22,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,碾碎他們吧，奧茲。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.22,0:16:53.35,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,當然！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.35,0:16:56.93,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:02.42,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.40,0:17:04.17,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}來福槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:17.68,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,唯一的魯夫...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.68,0:17:20.02,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,就是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:27.62,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,有什麼東西飛過來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:28.36,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:29.26,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,雨雲？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:32.26,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,不會吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.26,0:17:34.73,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,是奧茲！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:56.19,Main,Oars,0,0,0,,可惡...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:17:59.69,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:12.52,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:14.41,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他跟奧茲打得旗鼓相當！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.83,0:18:16.81,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,現在是我們的機會！開始搜索！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.39,0:18:18.58,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,喂⋯喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.58,0:18:21.55,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我找到一個希望之船員了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.95,0:18:23.51,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,這裡也有！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.51,0:18:25.62,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,好嚴重的傷。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.34,0:18:28.32,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,大家都被打得很慘。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:30.74,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,這個人被打到骨頭都看得見了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.79,0:18:33.92,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,把他們留在這裡很危險。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.92,0:18:35.76,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,快帶他們到安全的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.47,0:18:38.01,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他們在做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:40.00,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好多人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:41.62,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他們是殭屍嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:44.09,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他們要對索隆他們做什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:45.69,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,快回去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:48.21,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,喂喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:49.82,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,這到底怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.74,0:18:52.75,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,奧茲在輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.75,0:18:54.98,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,真不敢相信那種怪物居然在輸。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.69,0:19:04.67,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,怎⋯怎麼了，奧茲？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.71,0:19:09.41,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,喂！你聽說了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:14.43,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,莫利亞大人現在在奧茲的肚子裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.43,0:19:22.81,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,那就是說，Thriller Bark所有殭屍的主人，跟終極特殊殭屍一起被打敗了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:26.28,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,這什麼笑話？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.38,0:19:32.20,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,奧茲...五百年前被稱為魔人的傳說男人！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.20,0:19:35.20,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,而我們的主人可是王下七武海！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:36.92,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,月光·莫利亞大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.16,0:19:48.97,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.97,0:19:55.64,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,所以你們把100個受害者的影子塞進魯夫體內，\N才讓他變成那個樣子？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.64,0:19:58.67,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,沒錯，希望之船員。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.67,0:20:02.23,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,老實說，連我們都對他獲得的力量感到驚訝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.23,0:20:06.20,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,但是...那股力量只能再維持兩三分鐘了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:09.87,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,放入他體內的影子即將開始離開！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:12.86,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,抱歉擅自動了你們的船長，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:15.93,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們把所有的希望都託付給他了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.93,0:20:18.83,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們想重新做回人類！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:21.15,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他是我們最後的希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:24.22,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,快要天亮了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:28.21,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,島上所有受害者的命運將在接下來幾分鐘內決定。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:32.58,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,拜託你了，噩夢魯夫。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.39,0:20:50.49,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,宅邸在崩塌了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.49,0:20:52.90,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:57.65,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這真的太厲害了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.09,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.09,0:21:01.24,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,幹得好，魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.91,0:21:13.83,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.83,0:21:16.62,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,渺小的雜碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:19.30,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:23.06,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}子彈！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.67,0:21:34.33,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,可惡，奧茲！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:37.52,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,草帽小子到底從哪得到這種力量的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:38.73,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:41.15,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我可能會被波及。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.15,0:21:43.75,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我最好現在離開駕駛{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.83,0:21:45.75,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:49.26,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}手槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.70,0:22:03.27,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.81,0:22:10.07,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}戰斧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.55,0:22:16.65,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.44,0:22:20.79,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}暴風雨！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.38,0:22:34.60,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,奧茲被...！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:36.82,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,莫利亞大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.44,0:22:50.28,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他掉下來了，小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.77,0:23:21.46,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,影子...出來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:23.88,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，魯夫沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.79,0:23:32.94,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:34.09,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂！你沒事吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:37.36,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,我在做夢嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.36,0:23:39.56,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他贏了。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.56,0:23:43.32,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,是的，希望之船員做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.65,0:23:47.48,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,奧茲和莫利亞被打敗了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.48,0:23:50.29,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,所有人的影子都會回來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.82,0:23:52.58,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,Thriller Bark...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.34,0:23:57.18,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,陷落了！
